Third-party components
================================================================================

This template ships no third-party code by default. When you vendor a
dependency or redistribute a third-party model/asset, record it here and add its
license text under LICENSES/ (one file per SPDX identifier or per asset), per the
attribution requirements of that component's license (e.g. Apache-2.0 §4).

Example (delete if unused):

  - <component name> — <SPDX-id> — see LICENSES/<file>.txt
    Source: <upstream URL>
    Used in: <path(s)>
